Description: lightweight CLI for a private Compose home server
 Manage services on one Docker Compose host with health checks, controlled
 updates, automatic rollback, data backups, and restores.
 .
 Includes offline setup, backup, monitoring, and operation guides. Docker
 and private access are configured separately using the bootstrap guide.
